Z||000000||artherd||06-25-2001||08:49 AM||||Please excuse the entirely self-indungent post here, but I just had to tell someone  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Well, it's got 32 valves, 4 cams, makes ~300hp, is all aluminum, weighs less than a 2.8, and will fit in the engine bay, and bolt up to the Getrag  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I just spend the last hour or so in the garage (again) rowing through the gears in the non-running car (again) thinking about how cool it's going to be when all hooked together.<P>Now I just have to do some work on it, and find a way to earn some more money to pay for it all.<P>But boy oh boy is this gonna be fun!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
