Z||000005||artherd||06-26-2001||03:52 AM||||Well, it's average unlaiden velocity is approximately..... <P><BR>Heheheh! <P>Yes, it's a northstar, I paid around $1,000 for it, including shipping.  Has around 20,000miles on it, looks new, and came out of a 98 Eldorado. (aparently)<P>I found out it doesn't have the waterpump however (incidentally, the northstar water pump is really cool, and cam driven.)<P>Also, one of the exaust manifolds will need to be replaced I think, it appears bent.<P><BR>Best!<BR>Ben.<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
